sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UploadWizard as Upload Wizard
    participant API as API Routes
    participant TriggerDev as Trigger.dev
    participant AssemblyAI as AssemblyAI
    participant Grok as xAI Grok
    participant EpisodeWorkspace as Episode Workspace

    User->>UploadWizard: Navigate to /upload
    UploadWizard->>User: Step 1 - Select Audio
    User->>UploadWizard: Drop file or paste URL
    User->>UploadWizard: Continue

    UploadWizard->>User: Step 2 - Expert Context
    User->>UploadWizard: Continue

    UploadWizard->>User: Step 3 - Style and Assets
    User->>UploadWizard: Process Episode

    UploadWizard->>API: POST /api/upload
    API-->>UploadWizard: signedUrl

    UploadWizard->>API: POST /api/episodes
    Note over UploadWizard,API: BUG - No title field sent
    API-->>UploadWizard: episodeId

    UploadWizard->>API: POST /api/episodes/:id/process
    API->>TriggerDev: triggerEpisodeProcessing
    API-->>UploadWizard: runId

    UploadWizard->>EpisodeWorkspace: redirect to /episodes/:id

    TriggerDev->>AssemblyAI: Transcribe audio
    AssemblyAI-->>TriggerDev: Transcript
    TriggerDev->>Grok: Generate content
    Grok-->>TriggerDev: Assets
    TriggerDev->>API: Update status = completed

    User->>EpisodeWorkspace: View results
